/* digtab MODULE (primary-module-interface) */
/* charset=ISO8859-1 */
/* lang=C++20 */

/* retrieve a digit from the digit-table (DIGTAB) */
/* version %I% last-modified %G% */


/* revision history:

	= 1998-02-14, David A­D­ Morano
